  "caveats": [
    "All three unmasked DRL treatments hit the environment hang guard and are truncated; dagger-marked values are not full-episode quality comparisons.",
    "Physical development and holdout eval_wide sources each contain two duplicate treatment-seed runs (DQN seed 35474 and MaskablePPO seed 35474). Scheduling metrics are identical within each pair; the published seed summaries collapse to 60 independent treatment-seed rows, while timing values for those two seeds average two observations.",
    "The statistics metadata did not record a git commit; artifacts retain exact source hashes and commands but source_code_commit is null.",
    "Primary heuristic comparisons disable backfill. Both backfill modes were evaluated only for the sensitivity band in backfill_bands.csv.",
    "Selection JSON files are preserved from the frozen source snapshot. Their older rationale labels do not change the single-candidate winners but should not be read as evidence that Nemenyi eliminated candidates.",
    "Paper-curated artifacts include the exact generation script and reconstructed command. The paper workspace was not a Git repository, so source_code_commit remains null and script/source hashes provide the immutable identity."
  ],
